419
00:33:56,990 --> 00:33:58,660
Sim!

420
00:33:58,660 --> 00:34:00,660
Vamos lá! Ah, ele se levantou de novo.

421
00:34:09,250 --> 00:34:11,000
Vamos lá! Sim, sim!

422
00:34:11,000 --> 00:34:14,510
Yeah, yeah!

